# Send only application source, dependency declarations and the public Web build.
# Runtime databases, mail, keys, models, SDKs and virtualenvs never enter an image.
**
!backend/
!backend/*.py
!backend/requirements.txt
!backend/requirements.lock.txt
!build/
!build/web/
!build/web/**
!deploy/
!deploy/Dockerfile
!web/
!web/generate_offline_manifest.py
